  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Optional physical GPU telemetry",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**CPU mode intentionally provides no physical GPU measurements.** NVIDIA measurements are sampled every 60 seconds. Unsupported ECC/clock fields have support=0 and no fabricated error-count series. Xid diagnostics cover the current boot and last 15 minutes only. Post-inference placement is measured immediately after the synthetic request; later idle unloading does not indicate CPU fallback."
      }
    },
    {
